{"title":"Behavioural Data Analyst Roadmap","role":"Behavioural Data Analyst","summary":"A Behavioural Data Analyst analyzes behavioral data to understand how and why people interact with products, services, platforms, or environments.","facts":{"Current degree":"B.Tech / B.E.","Course":"Human-Computer Interaction / Cognitive Computing"},"about":[],"intro":[],"horizons":[],"sections":[{"heading":"Overview","kind":"other","blocks":[{"type":"h","text":"Career Overview"},{"type":"p","text":"A Behavioural Data Analyst analyzes behavioral data to understand how and why people interact with products, services, platforms, or environments."},{"type":"p","text":"The role sits at the intersection of:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Data analytics"},{"text":"Human-Computer Interaction"},{"text":"Psychology and cognitive science"},{"text":"User research"},{"text":"Product analytics"},{"text":"Statistics"},{"text":"Experimentation"},{"text":"Machine learning"},{"text":"Business intelligence"}]},{"type":"p","text":"Typical questions include:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Why are users abandoning a particular workflow?"},{"text":"Which product features increase engagement?"},{"text":"What causes users to stop using an application?"},{"text":"How do different user segments behave?"},{"text":"Which interface changes improve conversion?"},{"text":"What behavioral patterns predict churn?"},{"text":"How does cognitive load affect task completion?"}]},{"type":"p","text":"A realistic career path is:"},{"type":"flow","items":["B.Tech","Data / Product Analytics Intern","Behavioural Data Analyst","Product / Behavioral Analyst","Senior Behavioural Data Analyst","Lead / Staff Analyst","Principal Product / Behavioral Analytics"]}]},{"heading":"Career Horizons","kind":"horizons","blocks":[{"type":"table","header":["Career Stage","Primary Focus"],"rows":[[{"text":"Year 1"},{"text":"Programming, statistics, psychology fundamentals"}],[{"text":"Year 2"},{"text":"SQL, Python, data analysis, HCI"}],[{"text":"Year 3"},{"text":"Product analytics, experimentation, behavioral modeling"}],[{"text":"Year 4"},{"text":"Advanced analytics, ML, research projects"}],[{"text":"0–2 Years"},{"text":"Data / Product / Behavioural Analyst"}],[{"text":"2–5 Years"},{"text":"Product Analyst / Senior Behavioral Analyst"}],[{"text":"5–8 Years"},{"text":"Analytics Lead / Behavioral Science Lead"}],[{"text":"8+ Years"},{"text":"Principal Analyst / Behavioral Analytics Manager"}]]},{"type":"p","text":"The exact title varies considerably between employers. Similar positions may be called Product Analyst, User Behavior Analyst, Customer Analytics Analyst, UX Data Analyst, Behavioral Scientist, or Decision Scientist."}]},{"heading":"What to Build During the Degree","kind":"build","blocks":[{"type":"h","text":"Year 1 — Quantitative & Behavioral Foundation"},{"type":"h","text":"Mathematics"},{"type":"p","text":"Build fundamentals in:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Probability"},{"text":"Statistics"},{"text":"Descriptive statistics"},{"text":"Inferential statistics"},{"text":"Correlation"},{"text":"Regression fundamentals"},{"text":"Distributions"},{"text":"Hypothesis testing"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Programming"},{"type":"p","text":"Prioritize:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Python"},{"text":"SQL"},{"text":"JavaScript basics"}]},{"type":"p","text":"Python stack:"},{"type":"p","text":"Python"},{"type":"p","text":"├── NumPy"},{"type":"p","text":"├── pandas"},{"type":"p","text":"├── matplotlib"},{"type":"p","text":"└── seaborn"},{"type":"flow","items":["raw behavioral data","analysis","insight"],"label":"The objective is to become comfortable moving from"},{"type":"h","text":"Year 2 — Data Analytics + HCI"},{"type":"h","text":"SQL"},{"type":"p","text":"Become strong in:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"SELECT"},{"text":"WHERE"},{"text":"GROUP BY"},{"text":"HAVING"},{"text":"JOINs"},{"text":"Subqueries"},{"text":"CTEs"},{"text":"Window functions"},{"text":"CASE statements"},{"text":"Date/time operations"},{"text":"Aggregations"}]},{"type":"p","text":"A behavioral analyst should be able to analyze millions of event records efficiently."},{"type":"h","text":"HCI"},{"type":"p","text":"Learn:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"User-centered design"},{"text":"Usability"},{"text":"Interaction design"},{"text":"Information architecture"},{"text":"Mental models"},{"text":"Cognitive load"},{"text":"Human factors"},{"text":"User journeys"},{"text":"Task analysis"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Data Analysis"},{"type":"p","text":"Learn:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Data cleaning"},{"text":"Exploratory data analysis"},{"text":"Outlier detection"},{"text":"Feature engineering"},{"text":"Segmentation"},{"text":"Cohort analysis"},{"text":"Funnel analysis"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Year 3 — Product & Behavioural Analytics"},{"type":"p","text":"This is where the specialization becomes practical."},{"type":"h","text":"Product Analytics"},{"type":"p","text":"Learn:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"DAU / WAU / MAU"},{"text":"Retention"},{"text":"Churn"},{"text":"Conversion"},{"text":"Activation"},{"text":"Engagement"},{"text":"Session behavior"},{"text":"Feature adoption"},{"text":"Funnel analysis"},{"text":"Cohort analysis"}]},{"type":"p","text":"Example:"},{"type":"flow","items":["Acquisition","Signup","Activation","First Key Action","Repeated Usage","Retention","Conversion"]},{"type":"p","text":"The analyst investigates where users drop out and why."},{"type":"h","text":"Year 4 — Advanced Behavioural Analysis"},{"type":"p","text":"Learn:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"A/B testing"},{"text":"Experimental design"},{"text":"Causal inference fundamentals"},{"text":"Regression"},{"text":"Classification"},{"text":"Clustering"},{"text":"Time-series analysis"},{"text":"Predictive modeling"},{"text":"Survival analysis fundamentals"},{"text":"Customer segmentation"},{"text":"Behavioral prediction"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Machine Learning"},{"type":"p","text":"Useful models include:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Logistic regression"},{"text":"Decision trees"},{"text":"Random forests"},{"text":"Gradient boosting"},{"text":"K-means"},{"text":"PCA"},{"text":"Naive Bayes"},{"text":"Clustering methods"},{"text":"Recommendation fundamentals"}]},{"type":"p","text":"ML should support behavioral questions rather than become an unrelated ML portfolio."}]},{"heading":"Core Knowledge Areas","kind":"other","blocks":[{"type":"table","header":["Area","Target Level"],"rows":[[{"text":"Statistics"},{"text":"Advanced"}],[{"text":"Probability"},{"text":"Advanced"}],[{"text":"SQL"},{"text":"Advanced"}],[{"text":"Python"},{"text":"Advanced"}],[{"text":"pandas / NumPy"},{"text":"Advanced"}],[{"text":"Data Visualization"},{"text":"Advanced"}],[{"text":"HCI"},{"text":"Advanced"}],[{"text":"UX Fundamentals"},{"text":"Advanced"}],[{"text":"Cognitive Science"},{"text":"Intermediate–Advanced"}],[{"text":"Product Analytics"},{"text":"Advanced"}],[{"text":"Experimentation"},{"text":"Advanced"}],[{"text":"A/B Testing"},{"text":"Advanced"}],[{"text":"Behavioral Segmentation"},{"text":"Advanced"}],[{"text":"Regression"},{"text":"Advanced"}],[{"text":"Machine Learning"},{"text":"Intermediate–Advanced"}],[{"text":"Causal Inference"},{"text":"Intermediate"}],[{"text":"User Research"},{"text":"Intermediate–Advanced"}],[{"text":"Data Storytelling"},{"text":"Advanced"}],[{"text":"Dashboarding"},{"text":"Advanced"}],[{"text":"Business Analysis"},{"text":"Advanced"}]]}]},{"heading":"Behavioural Data Pipeline","kind":"other","blocks":[{"type":"p","text":"A behavioral analyst should understand the complete data lifecycle:"},{"type":"flow","items":["User Interaction","Event Tracking","Raw Event Data","Data Warehouse","Data Cleaning","Feature Engineering","Behavioral Analysis","Statistical Testing","Insight","Product / Business Decision"]},{"type":"p","text":"For example:"},{"type":"flow","items":["User clicks \"Start Course\"","Event recorded","User continues for 10 minutes","User exits","Session analyzed","Pattern discovered","UX hypothesis created","A/B test","Decision"]}]},{"heading":"Important Behavioral Metrics","kind":"other","blocks":[{"type":"h","text":"Engagement"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Sessions per user"},{"text":"Session duration"},{"text":"Feature usage"},{"text":"Interaction frequency"},{"text":"Active users"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Retention"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Day-1 retention"},{"text":"Day-7 retention"},{"text":"Day-30 retention"},{"text":"Cohort retention"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Conversion"},{"type":"flow","items":["Visitors","Signup","Activation","Purchase"]},{"type":"p","text":"Measure conversion between each stage."},{"type":"h","text":"Churn"},{"type":"p","text":"Understand:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Who leaves?"},{"text":"When do they leave?"},{"text":"What behavior precedes churn?"},{"text":"Which segments have higher churn?"}]}]},{"heading":"Major Projects","kind":"other","blocks":[{"type":"h","text":"Project 1 — E-Commerce Behaviour Analytics"},{"type":"p","text":"Analyze user activity:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Product views"},{"text":"Searches"},{"text":"Cart additions"},{"text":"Checkout"},{"text":"Purchases"},{"text":"Abandoned carts"}]},{"type":"p","text":"Build:"},{"type":"flow","items":["Traffic","Product View","Add to Cart","Checkout","Purchase"]},{"type":"p","text":"Analyze:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Funnel conversion"},{"text":"Customer segments"},{"text":"Repeat purchase behavior"},{"text":"Cart abandonment"},{"text":"Product engagement"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Project 2 — Mobile App User Behavior Analysis"},{"type":"p","text":"Analyze an application event dataset."},{"type":"p","text":"Investigate:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Session behavior"},{"text":"Feature adoption"},{"text":"User journeys"},{"text":"Retention"},{"text":"Churn"}]},{"type":"p","text":"Produce:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"SQL analysis"},{"text":"Python notebook"},{"text":"Dashboard"},{"text":"Business recommendations"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Project 3 — A/B Testing Project"},{"type":"p","text":"Example:"},{"type":"p","text":"Does a simplified checkout interface improve purchase conversion?"},{"type":"p","text":"Design:"},{"type":"flow","items":["Users","Random Assignment"]},{"type":"p","text":"├── Control"},{"type":"flow","items":["└── Treatment","Conversion Measurement","Statistical Test","Effect Size","Decision"]},{"type":"p","text":"Analyze:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Conversion rate"},{"text":"Statistical significance"},{"text":"Confidence intervals"},{"text":"Effect size"},{"text":"Practical significance"}]},{"type":"p","text":"Do not conclude that a change is useful simply because a p-value is below a threshold."},{"type":"h","text":"Project 4 — User Churn Prediction"},{"type":"p","text":"Build a model predicting whether a user is likely to churn."},{"type":"p","text":"Features might include:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Login frequency"},{"text":"Session duration"},{"text":"Number of features used"},{"text":"Days since last activity"},{"text":"Number of transactions"},{"text":"Support interactions"}]},{"type":"p","text":"Pipeline:"},{"type":"flow","items":["Raw User Data","Feature Engineering","Train/Test Split","Classification Model","Evaluation","Behavioral Interpretation"]},{"type":"p","text":"The important output is not merely model accuracy."},{"type":"p","text":"Explain:"},{"type":"p","text":"Which behaviors are associated with churn and what action could the product team take?"},{"type":"h","text":"Project 5 — Cognitive Load & Interface Study"},{"type":"p","text":"Compare two interface designs."},{"type":"p","text":"Measure:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Task completion time"},{"text":"Error rate"},{"text":"Number of interactions"},{"text":"Task completion"},{"text":"User-reported difficulty"}]},{"type":"p","text":"Example:"},{"type":"p","text":"Interface A ──→ Task Completion"},{"type":"p","text":"│"},{"type":"p","text":"├── Time"},{"type":"p","text":"├── Errors"},{"type":"p","text":"└── Satisfaction"},{"type":"p","text":"Interface B ──→ Task Completion"},{"type":"p","text":"Combine behavioral data with user research."},{"type":"p","text":"This project differentiates the candidate from a conventional Data Analyst."}]},{"heading":"Tools & Technologies","kind":"other","blocks":[{"type":"h","text":"Analytics"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Python"},{"text":"SQL"},{"text":"Excel"},{"text":"pandas"},{"text":"NumPy"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Visualization"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Power BI"},{"text":"Tableau"},{"text":"matplotlib"},{"text":"Plotly"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Product Analytics"},{"type":"p","text":"Exposure to platforms such as:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Google Analytics"},{"text":"Amplitude"},{"text":"Mixpanel"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Databases / Warehouses"},{"type":"p","text":"Understand at least one modern analytical database or warehouse:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"PostgreSQL"},{"text":"BigQuery"},{"text":"Snowflake"},{"text":"Redshift"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Data Science"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"scikit-learn"},{"text":"Jupyter"},{"text":"MLflow fundamentals"}]}]},{"heading":"Internship Strategy","kind":"internships","blocks":[{"type":"p","text":"Don't restrict applications to Behavioural Data Analyst."},{"type":"h","text":"High-value internship titles"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Data Analyst Intern"},{"text":"Product Analyst Intern"},{"text":"Business Analyst Intern"},{"text":"User Analytics Intern"},{"text":"UX Analytics Intern"},{"text":"Customer Analytics Intern"},{"text":"Marketing Analytics Intern"},{"text":"Data Science Intern"},{"text":"Decision Science Intern"},{"text":"Behavioral Science Intern"},{"text":"Research Analyst Intern"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Best environment"},{"type":"p","text":"Product companies are particularly useful because the student gets exposure to:"},{"type":"flow","items":["User Behavior","Product Metrics","Experimentation","Product Decision"]}]},{"heading":"Entry-Level Career Options","kind":"careers","blocks":[{"type":"table","header":["Role","Relevance"],"rows":[[{"text":"Behavioural Data Analyst"},{"text":"Very High"}],[{"text":"Product Analyst"},{"text":"Very High"}],[{"text":"UX Data Analyst"},{"text":"Very High"}],[{"text":"User Behavior Analyst"},{"text":"Very High"}],[{"text":"Customer Analytics Analyst"},{"text":"High"}],[{"text":"Data Analyst"},{"text":"Very High"}],[{"text":"Business Analyst"},{"text":"High"}],[{"text":"Marketing Analytics Analyst"},{"text":"Medium–High"}],[{"text":"Decision Science Analyst"},{"text":"High"}],[{"text":"Junior Data Scientist"},{"text":"High"}],[{"text":"Behavioral Science Analyst"},{"text":"Very High"}]]}]},{"heading":"Employer Skill Matrix","kind":"other","blocks":[{"type":"table","header":["Employer Type","Important Skills"],"rows":[[{"text":"SaaS/Product Companies"},{"text":"Product analytics + SQL + experimentation"}],[{"text":"E-commerce"},{"text":"Customer behavior + funnel + segmentation"}],[{"text":"FinTech"},{"text":"Risk + customer analytics + experimentation"}],[{"text":"EdTech"},{"text":"Learning behavior + retention"}],[{"text":"Healthcare Tech"},{"text":"User behavior + statistics + UX"}],[{"text":"Consumer Apps"},{"text":"Engagement + experimentation"}],[{"text":"Consulting"},{"text":"Analytics + visualization + communication"}],[{"text":"Market Research"},{"text":"Statistics + behavioral research"}]]}]},{"heading":"Certifications & Learning","kind":"certifications","blocks":[{"type":"p","text":"Certifications are secondary to actual analytical work."},{"type":"p","text":"Useful learning areas:"},{"type":"h","text":"Analytics"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"SQL"},{"text":"Python"},{"text":"Power BI/Tableau"},{"text":"Product analytics"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Statistics"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Experimental design"},{"text":"Regression"},{"text":"A/B testing"},{"text":"Causal inference"}]},{"type":"h","text":"HCI"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"UX research"},{"text":"Human factors"},{"text":"Cognitive science"},{"text":"Usability testing"}]},{"type":"p","text":"The strongest evidence is:"},{"type":"p","text":"SQL"},{"type":"p","text":"+"},{"type":"p","text":"Python"},{"type":"p","text":"+"},{"type":"p","text":"Behavioral Dataset"},{"type":"p","text":"+"},{"type":"p","text":"Statistical Analysis"},{"type":"p","text":"+"},{"type":"p","text":"Dashboard"},{"type":"p","text":"+"},{"type":"p","text":"Business Recommendation"}]},{"heading":"PG Options","kind":"pg_india","blocks":[{"type":"p","text":"A master's degree is not mandatory."},{"type":"p","text":"M.Tech / M.E."},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Computer Science"},{"text":"Data Science"},{"text":"AI & ML"},{"text":"Human-Computer Interaction"}]},{"type":"p","text":"M.Sc / M.S."},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Data Science"},{"text":"Statistics"},{"text":"Cognitive Science"},{"text":"HCI"},{"text":"Behavioral Science"},{"text":"Computational Social Science"}]},{"type":"h","text":"MBA"},{"type":"p","text":"Useful for later movement toward:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Product Management"},{"text":"Marketing Analytics"},{"text":"Business Strategy"},{"text":"Customer Strategy"}]},{"type":"p","text":"For a technically oriented path, Data Science, Statistics, HCI or Cognitive Science are generally more aligned than an MBA immediately after B.Tech."}]},{"heading":"Career Specializations","kind":"other","blocks":[{"type":"h","text":"1. Product Behaviour Analytics"},{"type":"p","text":"Analyze:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Feature usage"},{"text":"Retention"},{"text":"Conversion"},{"text":"User journeys"},{"text":"Product adoption"}]},{"type":"h","text":"2. Customer Behaviour Analytics"},{"type":"p","text":"Focus on:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Segmentation"},{"text":"Purchase behavior"},{"text":"Churn"},{"text":"Customer lifetime value"},{"text":"Customer journeys"}]},{"type":"h","text":"3. UX Analytics"},{"type":"p","text":"Combine:"},{"type":"p","text":"UX Research"},{"type":"p","text":"+"},{"type":"p","text":"Behavioral Data"},{"type":"p","text":"+"},{"type":"p","text":"Product Analytics"},{"type":"p","text":"This is one of the strongest combinations for an HCI graduate."},{"type":"h","text":"4. Behavioral Science Analytics"},{"type":"p","text":"Study:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Decision-making"},{"text":"Motivation"},{"text":"Cognitive biases"},{"text":"User behavior"},{"text":"Experimental psychology"}]},{"type":"p","text":"This route can require deeper academic training in behavioral science."},{"type":"h","text":"5. People / Workforce Analytics"},{"type":"p","text":"Analyze:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Employee engagement"},{"text":"Retention"},{"text":"Productivity"},{"text":"Hiring"},{"text":"Workforce behavior"}]},{"type":"h","text":"6. AI & Human Behavior"},{"type":"p","text":"An emerging specialization involving:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Human-AI interaction"},{"text":"AI adoption"},{"text":"User trust"},{"text":"AI explainability"},{"text":"Human decision-making"},{"text":"AI-assisted workflows"}]}]},{"heading":"Career Progression","kind":"growth","blocks":[{"type":"h","text":"Product Analytics Route"},{"type":"flow","items":["Data Analyst","Product Analyst","Senior Product Analyst","Lead Product Analyst","Principal Product Analyst","Head of Product Analytics"]},{"type":"h","text":"Behavioral Science Route"},{"type":"flow","items":["Behavioral Analyst","Senior Behavioral Analyst","Behavioral Science Lead","Principal Behavioral Scientist","Behavioral Science Director"]},{"type":"h","text":"Data Science Route"},{"type":"flow","items":["Data Analyst","Data Scientist","Senior Data Scientist","Staff Data Scientist","Principal Data Scientist"]}]},{"heading":"Emerging Technologies","kind":"other","blocks":[{"type":"p","text":"The field is increasingly influenced by:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Generative AI"},{"text":"AI agents"},{"text":"Multimodal interfaces"},{"text":"Human-AI interaction"},{"text":"Personalized AI"},{"text":"Recommender systems"},{"text":"Real-time analytics"},{"text":"Privacy-preserving analytics"},{"text":"Synthetic data"},{"text":"Causal ML"},{"text":"Experimentation platforms"},{"text":"Behavioral prediction"},{"text":"Computational social science"},{"text":"Digital phenotyping"}]},{"type":"p","text":"An important future capability is understanding behavioral data generated through AI interactions."},{"type":"p","text":"For example:"},{"type":"flow","items":["User","AI Assistant","Conversation","Interaction Events","Behavioral Data","Analysis","User Experience Improvement"]},{"type":"p","text":"This creates a growing intersection between HCI, AI and behavioral analytics."}]},{"heading":"Recommended Final Skill Stack","kind":"other","blocks":[{"type":"p","text":"Programming"},{"type":"p","text":"├── Python"},{"type":"p","text":"└── SQL"},{"type":"p","text":"Statistics"},{"type":"p","text":"├── Probability"},{"type":"p","text":"├── Hypothesis Testing"},{"type":"p","text":"├── Regression"},{"type":"p","text":"├── Experimental Design"},{"type":"p","text":"└── Causal Inference"},{"type":"p","text":"Analytics"},{"type":"p","text":"├── EDA"},{"type":"p","text":"├── Cohort Analysis"},{"type":"p","text":"├── Funnel Analysis"},{"type":"p","text":"├── Retention"},{"type":"p","text":"├── Churn"},{"type":"p","text":"└── Segmentation"},{"type":"p","text":"Product Analytics"},{"type":"p","text":"├── User Journeys"},{"type":"p","text":"├── Feature Adoption"},{"type":"p","text":"├── Conversion"},{"type":"p","text":"├── Engagement"},{"type":"p","text":"└── Experimentation"},{"type":"p","text":"HCI"},{"type":"p","text":"├── Usability"},{"type":"p","text":"├── Cognitive Load"},{"type":"p","text":"├── User Research"},{"type":"p","text":"├── Interaction Design"},{"type":"p","text":"└── Human Factors"},{"type":"p","text":"Visualization"},{"type":"p","text":"├── Power BI"},{"type":"p","text":"├── Tableau"},{"type":"p","text":"└── Python Visualization"},{"type":"p","text":"ML"},{"type":"p","text":"├── Classification"},{"type":"p","text":"├── Clustering"},{"type":"p","text":"├── Prediction"},{"type":"p","text":"└── Model Interpretation"}]},{"heading":"Target Profile by Graduation","kind":"other","blocks":[{"type":"p","text":"A strong graduate should be able to take a behavioral problem such as:"},{"type":"p","text":"\"Why are users abandoning our application after registration?\""},{"type":"p","text":"and independently perform:"},{"type":"flow","items":["Business Question","Define Behavioral Hypothesis","Identify Required Events","SQL Data Extraction","Data Cleaning","Cohort / Funnel Analysis","Statistical Analysis","Behavioral Segmentation","Visualization","Experiment / Validation","Product Recommendation"]},{"type":"p","text":"They should also be able to communicate the difference between:"},{"type":"p","text":"correlation, prediction and causation."},{"type":"p","text":"That distinction is particularly important in behavioral analytics."}]},{"heading":"Best Overall Positioning","kind":"other","blocks":[{"type":"p","text":"The strongest positioning for this specialization is:"},{"type":"p","text":"Product/Behavioural Data Analyst with strong HCI, statistics, experimentation and data science capabilities."},{"type":"p","text":"Rather than positioning solely as a generic Data Analyst."},{"type":"h","text":"Ideal progression"},{"type":"flow","items":["HCI + Cognitive Computing","Statistics + Python + SQL","Data Analytics","HCI + User Research","Product Analytics","Experimentation","Behavioral Modeling","Behavioural Data Analyst"]},{"type":"h","text":"Best final skill combination"},{"type":"flow","items":["Python","SQL","Statistics","Product Analytics","HCI","Experimentation","Behavioral Science","Machine Learning"],"sep":"+"},{"type":"p","text":"This combination gives the graduate a differentiated profile: not just analyzing what users did, but connecting behavioral evidence to why they behaved that way and what product decision should follow."}]}]}